# Portfolio site

Interactive portfolio for Daniel A Rodrigues. Single-page scroll layout with a chatbot centerpiece so visitors can explore professional experience and some personal background. Current features: streaming chat (OpenRouter via Route Handlers), MongoDB-backed threaded messages with TTL, resume download, experience timeline, skills, about, and album-driven visual themes.

## Stack

- Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, TypeScript (strict)
- Tailwind + shadcn/ui (`new-york`, themeable `surface-*` CSS variables, dark `color-scheme`)
- Backend: Route Handlers under `src/app/api/v1` + `src/server/` (MongoDB, OpenRouter)
- HTTP (client): native `fetch` + ReadableStream for chat SSE
- Path alias: `@/` → `src/`
- Skill logos: `simple-icons` via `@src/shared/skillIcons.ts`

## Layout

- App shell: `@src/app/page.tsx` (ThemeProvider + ChatProvider + navbar + sections), `@src/app/layout.tsx`
- UI: `@src/app/components/ui/` — shadcn primitives plus `navbar`, `hero`, `chatbot`, `chat-provider`, `theme-provider`, `theme-picker`, `theme-background`, `backgrounds/`, `experience-timeline`, `skills-grid`, `about-section`, `site-footer`, `scroll`
- Profile content (client-safe): `@src/shared/profile.ts`
- Theme registry: `@src/shared/themes.ts` (`ThemeId`, `THEMES`, default `blurryface`)
- API routes: `@src/app/api/v1/`
- Server logic: `@src/server/` (`db/`, `chat/`, `ai/` including `systemPrompt.ts`)
- Client API helpers: `@src/shared/` (`api.ts`, `endpoints.ts`, `config.ts`)
- Chat state: `@src/hooks/useChatThread.ts` exposed through `ChatProvider`
- Utils: `@src/lib/utils.ts` (`cn`)

## Theming

- Themes switch via `html[data-theme]` (`default` | `blurryface` | `ok-computer` | `blue-album`); picker lives in About (`theme-picker`)
- Default is the original zinc look (`default`); album themes are optional overlays — click again to deselect and revert
- Colors: use `surface-*` and `glow` / semantic tokens — never hardcode `zinc-*`
- New themes: add an entry in `@src/shared/themes.ts`, a `[data-theme]` block in `@src/app/globals.css`, and a background under `@src/app/components/ui/backgrounds/`

## Guardrails

- Extend `@src/shared/` for browser→API calls; do not invent parallel fetch wrappers
- Put server-only backend logic under `@src/server/` and Route Handlers under `@src/app/api/`
- Keep portfolio content in `@src/shared/profile.ts` in sync with facts in `@src/server/ai/systemPrompt.ts` when bio/experience changes
- Preserve themed dark portfolio UX; extend via `data-theme` rather than one-off color classes
- LLM calls go through OpenRouter (see `@v2-migration.mdc`); never put API keys in client code
- Do not reintroduce Telegram notify or title-generation endpoints unless explicitly requested
- New unit tests go under `tests/` (mirror `src/` paths; see `vitest-tests.mdc`); CI runs lint, typecheck, unit tests, and build on PRs and `main` (see `.github/workflows/ci.yml`); use the PR template for release-oriented descriptions
- After large features/redesigns, update `.cursor/rules/` in the same PR (`keep-rules-in-sync.mdc`; workflow skill `.cursor/skills/sync-cursor-rules/`)
